      <description>&lt;p&gt;Been playing small bursts of Forbidden Solitaire at lunch hour and it&amp;#39;s incredibly addictive to keep playing. I think the last card/dice game that got me in the &amp;quot;one more round&amp;quot; was Dicey Dungeons&lt;/p&gt;</description>
